; `:imports` is a `wgsl-ref-list`, a cross-reference to the `wgsl` form group
; only — so a name nothing declares is `not_cross_ref` from the validator, with
; no emitter code at all.
(shader-module :name m :imports [nothingDeclaresThis] :code """
@fragment fn fs() -> @location(0) vec4f { return vec4f(1.0); }
""")
